e carefully. This supplier is a source for many different products and it's crucial that we get the order correct so that the paper fits in the machine. We need to have an exact idea of what the finished product will look like so it needs to be pre-printed exactly like the final product will be.<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Okay. What exactly needs ordering?", "id": 2, "time": "33000", "image": "engenn10le09ob03re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: I'll get you the forms. Specific order forms need to be filled out. After you call and place the order, the forms need to be filed with the accounts payable department. By filing the forms, you will complete the order. If the forms aren't filed properly, the order won't be filled by the supplier. They are pre-paid for this product. Do you understand everything?<br><span class=\"strong\">Adam</span>: Yes, I think so. I'll order the paper using the forms. Giving the forms to accounts payable will finalize the order.<br><span class=\"strong\">Boris</span>: You got it. Let's go to work.", "id": 3, "time": "60000", "image": "engenn10le09ob03re2img07.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "type": "sena"}